WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.208 --> 00:00:32.500
In the previous verse, Lord Krishna explained

2
00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:34.583
how ignorant people

3
00:00:34.583 --> 00:00:36.416
see Lord Krishna as an

4
00:00:36.416 --> 00:00:38.333
ordinary human

5
00:00:38.333 --> 00:00:41.375
and fail to understand His divine existence.

6
00:00:41.375 --> 00:00:42.333
But

7
00:00:42.333 --> 00:00:44.208
when a person cannot recognise

8
00:00:44.208 --> 00:00:46.708
that divine form of Lord Krishna,

9
00:00:46.708 --> 00:00:48.958
what is the consequence?

10
00:00:48.958 --> 00:00:50.250
This is what

11
00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:53.708
Lord Krishna reveals through this verse.

12
00:00:58.833 --> 00:00:59.916
Lord Krishna

13
00:00:59.916 --> 00:01:02.625
reveals this secret to Arjun here –

14
00:01:02.625 --> 00:01:04.250
those who fail to understand

15
00:01:04.250 --> 00:01:07.708
His divine, eternal, and unique form,

16
00:01:07.708 --> 00:01:11.083
and treating Him as an ordinary mortal,

17
00:01:11.083 --> 00:01:12.750
disrespect Him –

18
00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:14.666
such people become confused

19
00:01:14.666 --> 00:01:16.916
in every direction of their lives.

20
00:01:16.916 --> 00:01:19.958
Their life becomes filled with despair.

21
00:01:19.958 --> 00:01:21.291
All their efforts,

22
00:01:21.291 --> 00:01:24.250
all their actions become futile,

23
00:01:24.250 --> 00:01:28.500
and they are left with nothing but failure.

24
00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:30.958
Lord Krishna further says clearly

25
00:01:30.958 --> 00:01:33.958
that those who cannot recognise His divine form

26
00:01:33.958 --> 00:01:36.916
can never attain liberation.

27
00:01:36.916 --> 00:01:39.541
They stray from the very path that could have

28
00:01:39.541 --> 00:01:41.041
freed them from the bondage

29
00:01:41.041 --> 00:01:42.541
of birth and death.

30
00:01:42.541 --> 00:01:44.458
Because the truth

31
00:01:44.458 --> 00:01:46.250
they have turned against

32
00:01:46.250 --> 00:01:48.750
is itself the supreme source of all knowledge.

33
00:01:48.750 --> 00:01:51.208
That divine form is the foundation of creation,

34
00:01:51.208 --> 00:01:52.500
the direction of the soul,

35
00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:55.833
and the guide to liberation.

36
00:01:55.833 --> 00:01:56.666
But

37
00:01:56.666 --> 00:02:00.208
when a person treats that
 divinity as merely material,

38
00:02:00.208 --> 00:02:01.375
when he makes the

39
00:02:01.375 --> 00:02:03.416
mistake of seeing Lord Krishna

40
00:02:03.416 --> 00:02:05.291
as an ordinary human,

41
00:02:05.291 --> 00:02:08.875
all his knowledge loses its direction.

42
00:02:08.875 --> 00:02:11.791
The more he tries to know, the deeper

43
00:02:11.791 --> 00:02:16.541
he pushes himself into the depths of darkness.

44
00:02:16.541 --> 00:02:19.291
His knowledge is now aimless.

45
00:02:19.291 --> 00:02:20.458
His efforts

46
00:02:20.458 --> 00:02:21.875
now become fruitless,

47
00:02:21.875 --> 00:02:24.833
and his life takes on the form of

48
00:02:24.833 --> 00:02:28.291
dissatisfaction, despair, and confusion.

49
00:02:28.291 --> 00:02:30.958
He attains no peace of soul,

50
00:02:30.958 --> 00:02:32.458
no success in action,

51
00:02:32.458 --> 00:02:35.125
and no clarity of mind.

52
00:02:35.125 --> 00:02:37.916
Such a person's life is like one

53
00:02:37.916 --> 00:02:39.958
who lives beside water

54
00:02:39.958 --> 00:02:43.250
yet remains thirsty out of ignorance.

55
00:02:43.250 --> 00:02:45.875
One who refuses to recognise the truth

56
00:02:45.875 --> 00:02:48.916
deprives himself of truth.

57
00:02:48.916 --> 00:02:50.666
And then what happens

58
00:02:50.666 --> 00:02:53.541
when the soul is cut off from the supreme truth?

59
00:02:53.541 --> 00:02:56.666
It turns toward degradation.

60
00:02:56.666 --> 00:02:57.958
The darkness of ignorance

61
00:02:57.958 --> 00:03:00.000
engulfs the mind,

62
00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:01.458
and he falls into

63
00:03:01.458 --> 00:03:04.166
demonic and destructive tendencies –

64
00:03:04.166 --> 00:03:09.291
where desire, anger, ego, envy,

65
00:03:09.291 --> 00:03:12.000
delusion, and lack of discernment

66
00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:14.000
become his natural state.

67
00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:15.625
These demonic tendencies

68
00:03:15.625 --> 00:03:18.166
hollow him out from within.

69
00:03:18.166 --> 00:03:20.125
In his life, peace

70
00:03:20.125 --> 00:03:21.625
gives way to unrest,

71
00:03:21.625 --> 00:03:24.250
and wisdom gives way to confusion.

72
00:03:24.250 --> 00:03:25.166
He never receives

73
00:03:25.166 --> 00:03:26.458
true knowledge,

74
00:03:26.458 --> 00:03:28.125
and when knowledge is absent,

75
00:03:28.125 --> 00:03:30.750
no guidance remains,

76
00:03:30.750 --> 00:03:32.750
no final destination.

77
00:03:32.750 --> 00:03:35.041
Life becomes a journey

78
00:03:35.041 --> 00:03:36.375
without purpose,

79
00:03:36.375 --> 00:03:39.291
and the destination that was meant to be reached

80
00:03:39.291 --> 00:03:41.750
is never reached.

81
00:03:41.750 --> 00:03:44.083
So through this verse,

82
00:03:44.083 --> 00:03:45.708
Lord Krishna tells us

83
00:03:45.708 --> 00:03:48.833
that for true spiritual progress

84
00:03:48.833 --> 00:03:50.333
we must become humble

85
00:03:50.333 --> 00:03:54.416
and understand this knowledge
 with an open heart.

86
00:03:54.416 --> 00:03:56.500
Not recognising Lord Krishna's

87
00:03:56.500 --> 00:03:59.375
divine form and His divine powers,

88
00:03:59.375 --> 00:04:01.791
we become spiritually

89
00:04:01.791 --> 00:04:03.458
blind.

90
00:04:03.458 --> 00:04:05.958
But when our heart

91
00:04:05.958 --> 00:04:09.041
is moved by exclusive devotion,

92
00:04:09.041 --> 00:04:12.750
then we are able to understand the real truth.

93
00:04:17.583 --> 00:04:19.416
Whenever

94
00:04:19.416 --> 00:04:23.541
someone doubts Me,

95
00:04:23.541 --> 00:04:25.291
argues instead of

96
00:04:25.291 --> 00:04:28.708
understanding My ways,

97
00:04:28.708 --> 00:04:31.583
or questions My grace –

98
00:04:31.583 --> 00:04:34.833
from that very moment, they

99
00:04:34.833 --> 00:04:38.666
distance themselves from the light of knowledge

100
00:04:38.666 --> 00:04:43.750
that I wish to offer them.

101
00:04:43.750 --> 00:04:47.833
And this is not something only with Me –

102
00:04:47.833 --> 00:04:52.333
it happens in every relationship in life.

103
00:04:52.333 --> 00:04:55.125
Whenever you take someone's

104
00:04:55.125 --> 00:04:58.333
genuine feeling as false,

105
00:04:58.333 --> 00:05:02.000
whenever you start looking for selfishness

106
00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:05.458
even in their true compassion,

107
00:05:05.458 --> 00:05:08.333
you cut yourself off from that love

108
00:05:08.333 --> 00:05:10.500
and support

109
00:05:10.500 --> 00:05:14.000
that was freely available to you.

110
00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:16.541
This kind of attitude

111
00:05:16.541 --> 00:05:22.583
creates distance in your relationships

112
00:05:22.583 --> 00:05:24.333
and your heart

113
00:05:24.333 --> 00:05:28.500
hardens toward them.

114
00:05:28.500 --> 00:05:30.416
This is the very cause

115
00:05:30.416 --> 00:05:34.166
of tension, mistrust,

116
00:05:34.166 --> 00:05:37.791
and disappointment being born in relationships.

117
00:05:37.791 --> 00:05:40.375
But when you hold

118
00:05:40.375 --> 00:05:45.250
toward people an attitude
 of trust and generosity,

119
00:05:45.250 --> 00:05:48.416
your relationships become stronger

120
00:05:48.416 --> 00:05:50.916
and more loving.

121
00:05:50.916 --> 00:05:52.791
That is why

122
00:05:52.791 --> 00:05:55.500
keep humility in your heart

123
00:05:55.500 --> 00:05:59.791
and generosity toward others.

124
00:05:59.791 --> 00:06:03.250
Stop expecting perfection

125
00:06:03.250 --> 00:06:07.958
from others or from your own life.

126
00:06:07.958 --> 00:06:11.750
Remain open and generous

127
00:06:11.750 --> 00:06:14.791
toward people and especially toward Me.

128
00:06:14.791 --> 00:06:17.041
Stay with an open heart.

129
00:06:17.041 --> 00:06:21.041
Not everything will make sense immediately.

130
00:06:21.041 --> 00:06:24.708
But if you let go of criticism

131
00:06:24.708 --> 00:06:28.916
and fill yourself with faith and trust,

132
00:06:28.916 --> 00:06:33.291
you will find peace and joy.

133
00:06:33.291 --> 00:06:35.375
This is the path

134
00:06:35.375 --> 00:06:36.708
by which you

135
00:06:36.708 --> 00:06:40.416
can be freed from the negativity

136
00:06:40.416 --> 00:06:43.625
that has been holding you back.

137
00:06:48.375 --> 00:06:50.875
You may have seen

138
00:06:50.875 --> 00:06:53.958
a family that was once

139
00:06:53.958 --> 00:06:58.166
flourishing greatly, and after some time

140
00:06:58.166 --> 00:06:59.708
that very family

141
00:06:59.708 --> 00:07:02.833
begins moving toward decline.

142
00:07:02.833 --> 00:07:06.583
Where there was once happiness and prosperity,

143
00:07:06.583 --> 00:07:09.500
now only unrest

144
00:07:09.500 --> 00:07:14.541
and dissatisfaction are seen.

145
00:07:14.541 --> 00:07:17.041
Do you know why this happens?

146
00:07:17.041 --> 00:07:19.166
The reason is

147
00:07:19.166 --> 00:07:23.250
the rejection of that spiritual foundation –

148
00:07:23.250 --> 00:07:24.500
the foundation

149
00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:27.833
that came to them through My teachings,

150
00:07:27.833 --> 00:07:32.416
and was the very cause
 of their happiness and prosperity.

151
00:07:32.416 --> 00:07:35.500
But when from a family

152
00:07:35.500 --> 00:07:39.375
this spiritual teaching disappears,

153
00:07:39.375 --> 00:07:44.000
then slowly the poison of selfishness, anger,

154
00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:48.500
and conflict begins to spread.

155
00:07:48.500 --> 00:07:51.500
Love is replaced by bitterness,

156
00:07:51.500 --> 00:07:53.833
harmony

157
00:07:53.833 --> 00:07:59.458
by resentment, cooperation by ego.

158
00:07:59.458 --> 00:08:04.208
However capable the family members may be,

159
00:08:04.208 --> 00:08:07.750
however intelligent they may be,

160
00:08:07.750 --> 00:08:12.208
if they turn away from these teachings,

161
00:08:12.208 --> 00:08:13.583
that family

162
00:08:13.583 --> 00:08:17.666
becomes worn out from inner hollowness.

163
00:08:17.666 --> 00:08:21.875
Whatever the outward show may be,

164
00:08:21.875 --> 00:08:25.166
they become weak on the inside.

165
00:08:25.166 --> 00:08:28.458
But a family that lives

166
00:08:28.458 --> 00:08:33.208
rooted in its spiritual foundation,

167
00:08:33.208 --> 00:08:34.541
that in its home

168
00:08:34.541 --> 00:08:37.208
remembers Me,

169
00:08:37.208 --> 00:08:40.083
and where compassion, humility,

170
00:08:40.083 --> 00:08:44.375
and service become the pillars of family life –

171
00:08:44.375 --> 00:08:45.916
only then

172
00:08:45.916 --> 00:08:50.166
does a family become happy and prosperous,

173
00:08:50.166 --> 00:08:53.041
and even in the greatest adversity

174
00:08:53.041 --> 00:08:55.791
remains fearless,

175
00:08:55.791 --> 00:08:58.458
and attains true strength

176
00:08:58.458 --> 00:09:00.916
and peace in life.

177
00:09:05.541 --> 00:09:07.166
At the workplace,

178
00:09:07.166 --> 00:09:11.250
when you make comments about others,

179
00:09:11.250 --> 00:09:14.791
assessing them on the surface

180
00:09:14.791 --> 00:09:19.791
and forming an opinion about them,

181
00:09:19.791 --> 00:09:23.416
you begin to see their faults

182
00:09:23.416 --> 00:09:26.791
without knowing their strengths.

183
00:09:26.791 --> 00:09:29.541
And I tell you,

184
00:09:29.541 --> 00:09:31.750
this mindset

185
00:09:31.750 --> 00:09:34.833
causes deep harm to the positive

186
00:09:34.833 --> 00:09:36.458
spirit of the workplace.

187
00:09:36.458 --> 00:09:38.000
Remember,

188
00:09:38.000 --> 00:09:42.708
a person who is filled with arrogance at work, 

189
00:09:42.708 --> 00:09:45.750
who looks down on his colleagues,

190
00:09:45.750 --> 00:09:50.375
who considers only his own ideas superior –

191
00:09:50.375 --> 00:09:54.083
he is, with his own hands,

192
00:09:54.083 --> 00:09:58.583
closing the doors of his own progress.

193
00:09:58.583 --> 00:10:00.833
It is exactly like

194
00:10:00.833 --> 00:10:05.000
those who do not understand My glory

195
00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:08.166
and lose their way in life –

196
00:10:08.166 --> 00:10:09.625
in the same way

197
00:10:09.625 --> 00:10:11.000
he fails to understand

198
00:10:11.000 --> 00:10:13.458
the abilities of those around him

199
00:10:13.458 --> 00:10:17.083
and strays from the path of success.

200
00:10:17.083 --> 00:10:21.166
Such a person gradually gets caught

201
00:10:21.166 --> 00:10:26.125
in a web of negativity and demonic tendencies,

202
00:10:26.125 --> 00:10:29.041
and because of this, at the workplace

203
00:10:29.041 --> 00:10:32.500
ego, contempt, resentment,

204
00:10:32.500 --> 00:10:36.250
and such feelings make their home there.

205
00:10:36.250 --> 00:10:38.250
And a workplace where there is no love

206
00:10:38.250 --> 00:10:42.083
and no spirit of cooperation –

207
00:10:42.083 --> 00:10:47.000
can such an organisation ever truly grow?

208
00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:48.958
No.

209
00:10:48.958 --> 00:10:51.791
Love and cooperation at the workplace

210
00:10:51.791 --> 00:10:53.791
are absolutely essential.

211
00:10:53.791 --> 00:10:58.166
And along with them, trust is essential.

212
00:10:58.166 --> 00:11:01.375
If there is no love and trust in an organisation,

213
00:11:01.375 --> 00:11:03.750
then the workplace feels

214
00:11:03.750 --> 00:11:07.416
no different from a battlefield.

215
00:11:07.416 --> 00:11:11.166
And if you want your workplace

216
00:11:11.166 --> 00:11:13.708
to not become a battlefield,

217
00:11:13.708 --> 00:11:14.750
then in your organisation,

218
00:11:14.750 --> 00:11:18.583
in the hearts of every member, 
keep love, cooperation,

219
00:11:18.583 --> 00:11:21.958
and the lamp of trust burning,

220
00:11:21.958 --> 00:11:25.208
because this is the key to success.

221
00:11:25.208 --> 00:11:26.916
Remember,

222
00:11:26.916 --> 00:11:29.875
knowledge too is meaningful

223
00:11:29.875 --> 00:11:32.541
only when people

224
00:11:32.541 --> 00:11:34.916
with an open mind, with generosity

225
00:11:34.916 --> 00:11:39.000
and warmth toward others, 
and with ego set aside,

226
00:11:39.000 --> 00:11:44.750
help to work together as a collective.

227
00:11:44.750 --> 00:11:47.000
When you let go of arrogance

228
00:11:47.000 --> 00:11:50.333
and work with dedication toward a

229
00:11:50.333 --> 00:11:51.708
shared purpose,

230
00:11:51.708 --> 00:11:55.125
not only does success come in your field,

231
00:11:55.125 --> 00:11:58.291
but within yourself too

232
00:11:58.291 --> 00:12:02.000
you become calm and balanced.
